What:           /sys/class/lcd/panel/thermal_max_brightness
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Independent maximum brightness request for A5/A7 Exynos7880
                panels. Decimal 0 releases the request and is the boot default;
                positive values are backlight indices up to EXTEND_BRIGHTNESS,
                interpreted through the selected panel's existing tables.

                Caps the applied brightness without modifying the requested
                backlight brightness. A lower request stays lower; releasing
                the cap reapplies the latest requested value. ALPM/AOD uses
                separate commands and is unaffected. A request made while the
                panel is off or in doze takes effect on normal display resume.

                The request persists until another write or reboot. Userspace
                must update it after restart and write 0 when releasing it.
